# SCSS formatting

- Put the opening **`{`** on a **new line** after the selector (same brace style as TypeScript class bodies in this project)

# SCSS property ordering

- **All CSS/SCSS properties must be alphabetized** within each selector block
- Sort by property name (e.g., `align-items`, `background-color`, `border`, `color`, `display`, `font-size`)
- Applies to all selector blocks, including nested selectors, pseudo-classes (`:hover`, `:active`, etc.), and pseudo-elements (`::placeholder`, etc.)
- Example: `{ align-items: center; background-color: $navy; display: flex; }` correct
- Example: `{ display: flex; align-items: center; background-color: $navy; }` incorrect
